            "comment": "In RTL, a Sheet's `side` is the physical edge again, as in shadcn: `side=\"left\"` opens on the left. To open from the start edge, pass `side={direction === \"rtl\" ? \"right\" : \"left\"}`. A Sidebar's mobile Sheet now opens from the same edge as the desktop Sidebar."
          }
